82
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:46,358
Not answering you would be
better for both our sakes.

83
00:04:54,780 --> 00:04:55,780
Zoro!

84
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,900
Sir Zoro!

85
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:01,940
What happened to Zoro, Kin'emon?

86
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,800
Sir Zoro just vanished!

87
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:12,700
Kin'emon!

88
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:14,760
I'm gonna help you!

89
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:21,000
Oh, yeah, that's Sea
Prism Stone, isn't it?

90
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,980
Hey, Keenemon, are you okay?

91
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:24,680
Come on, answer me!

92
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:26,764
