95
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:47,280
A long-range sword attack.

96
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:50,597
I can't believe that
old blind gambler turned

97
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:53,880
out to be a Navy Admiral
this whole time. That guy!

98
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,360
Thank you for your help before.

99
00:05:56,800 --> 00:06:01,020
I fear I may seem ungrateful
turning my blade on you as I am,

100
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:03,320
but I do not intend to be callous.

101
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:07,340
Fate can be a cruel and
ironic mistress at times.

102
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:11,740
This man, who stands here
alongside Doflamingo,

103
00:06:12,700 --> 00:06:14,780
is a Navy Admiral.

104
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:18,057
It would see what, what?

105
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:21,877
Wait—so there's a navy admiral
just hanging out and dress rosa.

106
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,790
Then

107
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:27,957
perhaps that means doflamingo is
allied with the navy in that event?

108
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:30,537
We could have countless enemies to face.

109
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:36,337
Wake up, please, sir!

110
00:06:36,420 --> 00:06:37,397
Law—are you kidding me?

111
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,517
Both of them can fly—how are you?

112
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,140
how are you Faring!

113
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,960
Please answer us!

114
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:48,300
Let's have a chit-chat back
at the palace, Fujitora.

115
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:51,317
If I can convince you
to cooperate with me,

116
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,837
