147
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:34,930
What's up?

148
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:36,677
You actually see her on the ship?

149
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:41,407
Can't confirm that, but I do see those
two weirdos from Fishman Island, though.

150
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:47,697
Mama, confirming that
we have located Caesar.

151
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:51,074
Oi, they have been hostage
just as we speculated before.

152
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:56,044
Let us send them on our bon voyage by
seeking the ship to recolor Monsieur Caesar.

153
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:58,240
Oh, great!

154
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,137
Now we're dealing with Big Mom, too?

155
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:02,717
Damn it, Luffy, you shouldn't
have picked a fight with her!

156
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,517
Seems like they're here for Caesar.

157
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,430
Caesar?

158
00:09:06,100 --> 00:09:09,240
Why are you so popular
every damn place that we go?

159
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:11,700
Did they come to rescue you, too?

160
