They're here to kill me, surely!

161
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:21,153
I am begging you, I don't want
to be captured by Big Mom!

162
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,264
Please, it'll be the end of me!

163
00:09:24,780 --> 00:09:27,368
Look, I stole research
funds from her, okay?

164
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,300
You did what?

165
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:35,449
Well, skip the details,
it's not important.

166
00:09:35,740 --> 00:09:39,057
