hand you over, so shut up, okay?

170
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:48,340
Hang it open, fire on us!

171
00:09:56,420 --> 00:10:00,008
We're getting pushed further
and further away from just Rosa.

172
00:10:00,780 --> 00:10:02,197
Think we can shake him off?

173
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,221
Everything okay?

174
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:04,630
Hey, listen,

175
00:10:04,820 --> 00:10:08,337
I don't think it would be a good idea
to leave an emperor back to Dressrosa.

176
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:10,657
It'll just throw the whole
kingdom into mass hysteria

177
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:13,037
and knock the whole Bito
Flamingo plan out of whack,

178
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:13,950
you know?

179
00:10:14,033 --> 00:10:16,717
Come to think of it, why is
Caesar back on the sunny?

180
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:19,037
Was it not obvious the
deal crumbled apart?

181
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,657
Why else would Traffy have
gotten his ass beaten, huh?

182
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:22,570
Yeah,

183
00:10:22,653 --> 00:10:25,177
we're stuck with him because Law told
us to take him to the next island,

184
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:26,090
unfortunately.

185
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:27,617
I'm with Franky on this one.

186
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:31,053
I don't think we should take
him anywhere near Dressrosa.

187
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:36,247
Listen, Sanji, I'm not saying
this because I want to run away.

188
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:40,960
There are three main things that
Doflamingo and us are fighting for.

189
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:47,140
Caesar, the Smile Factory, and
for some reason, Momonosuke.

190
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:50,917
We obviously haven't completed our
mission to destroy the factory yet,

191
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,040
so he's got one.

192
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:57,294
But fortunately, we have the other
two pieces right here with us, get it?

193
00:10:58,500 --> 00:11:01,857
Traffy sacrificed himself and
fought Doflamingo as a decoy

194
00:11:01,940 --> 00:11:04,877
so we could move these two
things away from his reach.

195
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:09,857
I believe he was also trying to buy us some
extra time for the factory plan as well.

196
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:13,317
He put himself through all that
just to help give us an edge.

197
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:17,297
Now if we go back just to make it easy
for Doflamingo to snatch the two of them,

198
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:21,960
then his sacrifice will
have been for nothing.

199
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:29,290
Gotcha.

200
00:11:29,373 --> 00:11:30,260
Good point.

201
00:11:31,580 --> 00:11:35,800
And we'll just have to take
Traffy back at all costs!

202
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,492
What's the name of the next island again?

203
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:40,880
That would be Zoe.

204
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:45,950
Saji!

205
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,550
Nami!

206
00:11:48,740 --> 00:11:49,570
Chopper!

207
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:51,490
Brooke!

208
00:11:52,340 --> 00:11:53,170
Mama!

209
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:56,460
You guys move on ahead and go!

210
