218
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,720
True that.

219
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:26,877
That's way too dangerous.

220
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,200
Please, don't!

221
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:31,860
Alright, everyone.

222
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:33,454
We'll see you in zone.

223
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,270
Got it.

224
00:12:35,353 --> 00:12:36,183
Don't worry.

225
00:12:36,266 --> 00:12:39,001
You can leave all the
factories smashing up to us.

226
