238
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:36,186
But good luck breaking my barrier
with those little baby kicks.

239
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:42,860
What do you want?

240
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,437
I'm in the middle of something here.

241
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:46,226
Curb the attitude, Dellinger.

242
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:50,797
I was going to ask if you were done with
Bellamy, but it seems you're still at it.

243
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:53,380
You're too slow it's not my fault.

244
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:54,800
I got interrupted

245
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,497
It's fine.

246
00:13:57,580 --> 00:13:58,940
Just finish him later!

247
00:14:00,500 --> 00:14:02,540
Duffy has a new order for you.

248
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:07,480
Go guard the toy house with Lao
Ji and his group on the double.

249
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:08,820
Come on Diamante.

250
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:11,377
